WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.304
MIKE POMPEO TO THE SENATE FLOOR.

00:00:02.369 --> 00:00:05.405
IT'S EXPECTED TO SUCCEED BUT

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:08.441
IT'S THE ISSUE OF GETTING IT OUT

00:00:05.539 --> 00:00:11.711
OF COMMITTEE.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:13.647
WE WOKE UP THIS MORNING THINKING

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:14.281
THE NOMINATION WOULD NOT ADVANCE

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.015
BECAUSE KENTUCKY

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.349
SENATOR RAND PAUL WAS GOING TO

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:17.517
VOTE FOR DEMOCRATS AND IT

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:18.718
WOULDN'T BE ENOUGH.

00:00:17.651 --> 00:00:20.787
THERE WAS A CHANGE IN THAT, AND

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:22.522
THEN WE THOUGHT MAYBE HE WOULD

00:00:20.921 --> 00:00:24.324
GET OUT OF COMMITTEE WITH WHAT'S

00:00:22.656 --> 00:00:24.925
CALLED A FAVORABLE

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:27.294
RECOMMENDATION.

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:28.628
THEN ONE REPUBLICAN SENATOR IS

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.996
ABSENT, SENATOR ISAKSON IS IN

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:35.836
GEORGIA ATTENDING A FUNERAL.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:36.203
NOW THEY ARE DEADLOCKED AT

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:39.439
AT 10-10.

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:48.381
THIS HAPPENED RIGHT BEFORE THIS

00:00:39.573 --> 00:00:49.115
MEETING.

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:49.783
HAVING RECEIVED ASSURANCES FROM

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:50.483
PRESIDENT TRUMP AND DIRECTOR

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.151
POMPEO THAT HE AGREES WITH THE

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:51.785
PRESIDENT ON THESE IMPORTANT

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:52.519
ISSUES, I HAVE DECIDED TO

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:53.153
SUPPORT HIS NOMINATION TO BE OUR

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:53.887
NEXT SECRETARY OF STATE.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:55.755
HE JOINS DEMOCRATIC SENATORS

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.456
HEIDI HEITKAMP, JOE DONNELLY,

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.757
AND JOE MANCHIN AND SUPPORTED

00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:58.592
THE NOMINATION.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:03.930
LIKELY ENOUGH TO CONFIRM.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:04.965
THE PRESIDENT TWEETED:

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.632
"HARD TO BELIEVE OBSTRUCTIONISTS

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:06.233
MAY VOTE AGAINST MIKE POMPEO

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:06.867
FOR SECRETARY OF STATE.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.467
THE DEMS WILL NOT APPROVE

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:08.602
INCLUDING THE AMBASSADOR TO

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:09.336
GERMANY.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.103
THEY ARE MAXING OUT THE TIME ON

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:10.837
APPROVAL PROCESS FOR ALL,

00:01:10.237 --> 00:01:15.408
NEVER HAPPENED BEFORE.

00:01:10.971 --> 00:01:20.280
NEED MORE REPUBLICANS!"

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:21.514
&gt;&gt; MAJORITY OF DEMOCRATS

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:21.915
CONTINUE THEIR POINTLESS

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:23.850
OBSTRUCTION.

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:24.885
A WILLFUL ATTEMPT TO UNDERMINE

00:01:23.984 --> 00:01:25.919
AMERICAN DIPLOMACY.

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:27.520
&gt;&gt; DEMOCRATS CLAIM THEY OPPOSE

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:28.755
POMPEO BECAUSE THEY SAY HE WILL

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:30.090
FAIL TO CHECK THE PRESIDENT'S

00:01:28.889 --> 00:01:31.324
WORST INSTINCTS.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:35.695
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE OUR NATION'S TOP

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:36.897
DIPLOMAT MUST BE FORTHRIGHT.

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:38.131
HIS PAST SENTIMENTS DO NOT

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.532
REFLECT OUR NATION'S VALUES AND

00:01:38.265 --> 00:01:40.300
ARE NOT ACCEPTABLE FOR THE TOP

00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:42.302
TO THE LEFT.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.769
I BELIEVE THE AMERICAN PEOPLE

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.504
DESERVE BETTER.

00:01:42.903 --> 00:01:46.206
&gt;&gt; REPUBLICAN SAY POMPEO HAS THE

00:01:44.638 --> 00:01:47.107
TRUST OF THE PRESIDENT AND NOTE

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:50.310
THAT THE SENATE CONFIRMED HIM AS

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:52.913
CIA DIRECTOR.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:53.813
AS THE NATIONAL SECURITY FOCUSED

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:55.682
NOMINEE, THEY SAY POMPEO

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:57.884
DESERVES CONFIRMATION, JUST AS

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:59.286
THE SENATE EASILY CONFIRMED

00:01:58.018 --> 00:02:00.120
