00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:01.087
PRESIDENT BARACK OBAMA,

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:01.521
GEORGE W. BUSH AND THEIR

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:04.691
PREDECESSORS.

00:02:01.655 --> 00:02:05.725
REPUBLICAN SAY THEY ARE PUSHING

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:07.093
TO CONFIRM POMPEO.

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:09.529
NATO HAS A MEETING THIS WEEK.

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:09.829
POMPEO SAYS HE WANTS TO BE

00:02:09.663 --> 00:02:11.231
THERE.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:12.732
