00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:27.881
KIM JONG UN.

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:29.316
THAT IS SOMETHING POMPEO HAS

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:32.919
BEEN INTIMATELY INVOLVED IN,

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:34.120
