00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:42.228
CONFIRM SECRETARY OF STATE.

00:02:40.694 --> 00:02:43.697
STEVE WANT TO BE CLEAR, SO RIGHT

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:45.832
NOW THEY ARE TRYING TO FIGURE

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.132
