00:02:55.442 --> 00:02:58.611
BECAUSE THE DEMOCRATS WHO ARE

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:59.112
GOING TO VOTE FOR POMPEO.

00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:01.915
&gt;&gt; THAT'S RIGHT.

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:03.683
